verification_loop:
Before reporting done, verify with a check you write:
  - the artifact validates against the sealed schema;
  - the domain is unchanged against `input/oracle.json`, one row per anchor;
  - every named span round-trips as UTF-8 against the file bytes;
  - contract §4.3 holds — no anchor occurrence repeated in its own roles;
  - every digest matches the contract's definition.
Report what you checked and what the checks found.
